flowchart TD
  Start[Pod starts] --> Startup{Startup probe}
  Startup -->|fail timeout| Kill[Container restart]
  Startup -->|pass| ReadyCheck{Readiness probe}
  ReadyCheck -->|fail| NoTraffic[Removed from Service no traffic]
  ReadyCheck -->|pass| Traffic[Receives traffic]
  Traffic --> Live{Liveness probe}
  Live -->|fail| Kill
  Live -->|pass| Traffic
  NoTraffic -->|DB recovers| ReadyCheck

